                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "745d6444-8a77-3cb4-9da9-6ed355645877",
                        "entry_id": "9a0902aa-f083-38bc-ba4d-2a6560f80464",
                        "glosses": [
                            "coulibiac"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "842d3bc1-0d67-440b-b5f8-a2ec2187e88a",
                                "sense_id": "745d6444-8a77-3cb4-9da9-6ed355645877",
                                "text": "Вме́сто жи́рной кулебя́ки яви́лись начинё́нные во́здухом пирожки́<...>.",
                                "translation": "Ivan Goncharov",
                                "english": "Ivan Goncharov"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb186d4b-7c97-48ab-a24b-99e64965fcf1",
                                "sense_id": "745d6444-8a77-3cb4-9da9-6ed355645877",
                                "text": "— Ну-с, пе́ред кулебя́кой вы́пить, — продолжа́л секрета́рь вполго́лоса; он уже́ так увлё́кся, что, как пою́щий солове́й, не слы́шал ничего́, кро́ме со́бственного го́лоса. — Кулебя́ка должна́ быть аппети́тная, бессты́дная, во всей свое́й наготе́, чтоб собла́зн был.",
                                "translation": "“Well, sirs, so drink before the kulebiak,” the secretary went on in a low voice; he was so carried away by now that, like a singing nightingale, he heard nothing but his own voice. “The kulebiak should be appetizing, shameless, in all its nakedness, so that there’s real temptation.<...>”",
                                "english": "“Well, sirs, so drink before the kulebiak,” the secretary went on in a low voice; he was so carried away by now that, like a singing nightingale, he heard nothing but his own voice. “The kulebiak should be appetizing, shameless, in all its nakedness, so that there’s real temptation.<...>”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
